1
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,820
希望泰德喜欢吃三文鱼
Oh, I hope Tad likes salmon.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:05,960
第一次来邓菲家做客
It's a bit of a risk serving fish

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,620
就给他吃鱼还是挺有风险的
to a first-time diner at Dunphy's.

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,360
要不我还是腌块牛排做候补吧
Maybe I should marinate a steak for backup.

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,140
有人好像爱上某男了哦
I think someone has a man crush.

6
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,660
首先 我绝不会和未来的客户约会
First of all, I would never date a potential client.

7
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,160
你该先澄清一下性取向吧
That's "First of all"?

8
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,800
其次 此次晚餐必须顺利进行
Secondly, I really need this to go well

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,060
那样他才会选我做房产经纪人 那家伙炒房地产
so he makes me his realtor. This guy's flipping properties

10
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,820
堪比功夫电影中令人炫目的动作
like they're extras in a kung fu movie.

11
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,980
所以你是为了钱才猛拍他马屁吗
So you're just kissing up to this guy for his money?

12
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,460
不仅仅是钱 我真的喜欢他
Not just. I really like him.

13
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,360
他周游各国 乐善好施
He travels the world doing charity work,

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,520
会攀岩 会开飞机
rock climbs, flies planes...

15
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,480
他怎么有时间做那么多事啊
How does he have time to do all that?

16
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,380
他离婚了 于是开辟了新的人生
Got divorced, and his whole life opened up.

17
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,880
他简直过着梦一般的生活啊
Guy's living the dream.

18
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:36,500
他的梦
His dream.

19
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,460
不是我的梦 我的梦想就在这里
Not my dream. I'm living my dream.

20
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,780
你就是我的美梦
You're my dream.

21
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,540
少来这套
You can stop.

22
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,020
我真心不想做这个
I so don't want to do this.

23
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,240
最近 海莉在她的
Recently, Haley got a little creative

24
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,640
某张大学申请表上突发奇想
on one of her college applications

25
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:50,260
说自己是一名"大姐姐"
and listed herself as a "Big Sister."

26
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,640
严格地说 我本来就是家中大姐姐
Technically, I am a big sister.

27
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:54,460
她把"大"和"姐"都突出强调
She capitalized the "B" And the "S."

28
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,762
倒也说得通 那组织就是假"大"虚空 贱"姐"无数
Which makes sense, 'cause it was.

29
00:00:57,351 --> 00:00:58,600
所以克莱尔和我建议
So Claire and I suggested--

30
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,000
是强迫
Forced.

31
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:02,140
她去大哥哥大姐姐会做志愿工作
that she volunteer for the organization.

32
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,760
我们为她自豪得不行了
We couldn't be prouder.

33
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,680
其实可以
We could.

34
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:06,680
再自豪一点的
Little bit.

35
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,640
老爸
Hey, dad?

36
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,880
是你不小心把这本专门嘲笑律师的
Did you accidentally leave this hilarious book

37
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,280
笑话书落在客房的吗
Of lawyer jokes in the guest room?

38
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,200
要是你能问答以下问题 我就告诉你
I'll tell you if you can answer the following question--

39
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:15,420
一条鲶鱼和一名律师
What's the difference between

40
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:18,300
-二者的区别是什么 -不知道 是什么
- a catfish and a lawyer? - I don't know. What?

41
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,644
一个在烂泥里打混 靠榨取底层生物过活
Well, one's a bottom-feeding mud-dweller.

42
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:21,900
另一个则是一条鱼
The other's a fish.

43
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:22,920
犀利
zing!

44
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,480
正中目标
Honk!

45
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,660
好了各位 晚餐已经好了
Okay, everyone, dinner is served!

46
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:27,260
准备开饭吧
let's get it!

47
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:29,260
我们的房子正在消毒 所以杰和歌洛莉亚
Our house is being fumigated, so Jay and Gloria

48
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:30,880
邀请我们回娘家住几天
invited us to stay here for a few days.

49
00:01:30,936 --> 00:01:34,240
我真高兴能和她一起共度72小时
I am very excited to have 72 hours with this one.

50
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:36,000
我们平时相处的时间很少
We don't get to spend much time together,

51
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,740
可以想象这几天我们会像是
so I know that we're gonna be like, um...

52
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:40,660
弗雷德和琴吉
Fred and Ginger?

53
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:41,700
谁啊
Who?

54
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:44,800
电影之夜
Movie night!

55
00:01:48,324 --> 00:01:50,674
比平时要吵闹好几倍
It's nosier than usual around here.

56
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:53,400
我的娘啊
oh, gosh!

57
00:02:07,237 --> 00:02:09,040
泰德 真是极品好酒啊
Tad, this wine is fantastic.

58
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,100
在门多萨呆上一周[阿根廷 盛产葡萄]
Spend a week in Mendoza,

59
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:12,660
你就会发现一堆马尔贝克酒生产商
and you'll find a dozen or so Malbec producers

60
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:15,080
可以酿出堪比波尔多酒的美酒佳酿
that'll give most Bordeaux a real run for their money.

61
00:02:16,216 --> 00:02:17,060
抱歉
Mm. I'm sorry.

62
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:18,240
酒瓶上应该贴个警告
This should come with a warning--

63
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,800
"可能导致装逼说大话行为"
"May cause pretentiousness."

64
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:23,380
该贴警告标签的是你 "极品帅男 靠近危险"
You should come with a warning-- "May be fascinating."

65
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:25,300
-抱歉 -天啊
- Oh! Excuse me. -Oh, gosh!

66
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:27,300
该死的螺丝老是松出来 都第九次了
Oh, that's, like, the ninth time this screw has popped out.

67
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:29,360
那个 我需要一个直角螺丝刀
Oh, you know what? I need the angled screwdriver.

68
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,380
可我把它落在办公室了
I left it at the office.

69
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:33,955
我把它留在那是因为我的那些标记牌
I, um, I keep it there because of--of all my signs.

70
00:02:34,203 --> 00:02:36,154
我用它来钉"待售"的牌子
I'll, uh, put up a "For sale" sign,

71
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,460
然后保证第二天
and next day, of course,

72
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:39,330
-我就会换上个"已售"的牌子了 -没错
- I gotta put up the "Sold" banner. - Yeah.

73
00:02:39,330 --> 00:02:41,180
然后第三天 同样的情况 "待售"
Then the next day, same deal--"For sale"

74
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:41,820
"已售"
"Sold."

75
00:02:41,943 --> 00:02:44,131
"待售——已售""待售——已售"
"For sale." "Sold." "For sale." "Sold."

76
00:02:44,131 --> 00:02:45,080
你真是个很棒 很棒的推销员
You're a great-- great salesman.

77
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,180
-我明白了 -"待售——已售"
- I'm getting that. - "For sale." "Sold."

78
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:49,093
很好 那个 我得回家好让保姆下班了
Right. Listen, I-I-I gotta go relieve the babysitter.

79
00:02:49,093 --> 00:02:51,640
我前妻带走了我一半的财产
My ex-wife took 50% of my stuff

80
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,500
却留下了所有的孩子
and left me 100% of my kids.

81
00:02:54,072 --> 00:02:55,889
-孩子们很不错 - 我说
- They're great. Hey, listen, um,

82
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,460
非常感谢你的光临
thank you so much for coming.

83
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,800
哪里 我才要谢谢你 菲尔
Oh, no, thank you, Phil, so much

84
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,940
谢谢你们做的三文鱼 牛排
for the salmon and the steak

85
00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,620
还有鸡肉和大虾
and the chicken and the shrimp.

86
00:03:03,620 --> 00:03:05,288
每一样都很美味
I mean, it was all just delicious.

87
00:03:05,288 --> 00:03:07,113
-太好了 -能有这样的贤妻 他真走运
- Oh, great. - This guy is very lucky to have you.

88
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:10,200
好 那就多谢了
Okay. Thanks.

89
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:11,140
没问题
Yeah.

90
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:13,600
好吧
All right.

91
00:03:14,245 --> 00:03:15,437
-让我帮你开门 -行
- Let me grab that. -Yeah.

92
00:03:15,564 --> 00:03:16,444
非常感谢 再见
Yeah. Thanks so much. Bye-bye.

93
00:03:16,444 --> 00:03:17,499
再见
Bye-bye.

94
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:22,140
你看到那一幕没
Did you see that?

95
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,960
握手差点变成拥抱吗
A handshake that almost became a hug?

96
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,480
当然看见了 我是当事人啊 我成功了
Yeah, I saw it. I lived it. I think I'm in.

97
00:03:26,490 --> 00:03:28,385
不 亲爱的 是他亲到我的嘴
No, honey. He kissed me on the lips.

98
00:03:28,385 --> 00:03:30,827
-又一个好信号 -这不是什么好信号
- Another good sign! - It's not a good sign.

99
00:03:30,827 --> 00:03:32,580
亲爱的 你不觉得这很古怪吗
Sweetie, you don't think that's weird?

100
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:34,100
那家伙满世界乱跑
Well, the guy's a world traveler.

101
00:03:34,100 --> 00:03:35,620
他曾在哥斯达黎加呆过一段时间
He has a time share in Costa Rica.

102
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:36,800
也许是受那里的习俗影响吧
That's probably how they do it there.

103
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,280
我不知道 亲爱的 感觉他在我唇上流连忘返
I don't know, honey. It felt like he lingered.

104
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,920
人家是先进性文化嘛
It's a progressive culture.

105
00:03:41,435 --> 00:03:43,266
出行都得靠索道滑行
Most of them travel by zip line.

106
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,480
饼干配肉汁
biscuits and gravy?

107
00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:49,640
我奶奶贝奇的独家秘方
Yep, my grandma Bitsy's secret recipe,

108
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:52,420
从她管家黛丽拉那里学到的
given to her by her housekeeper Delilah,

109
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:54,020
她养大了我奶奶 也是她最好的朋友
Who raised her and was her best friend--

110
00:03:54,020 --> 00:03:56,000
就像电影《相助》一样 除了黛丽拉是白人
kind of like "The help," except Delilah was white,

111
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,900
而且是个种族主义者
and was actually herself quite the racist.

112
00:03:59,160 --> 00:03:59,920
放开肚子吃吧
Eat up.

113
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:01,600
早安
Good morning!

114
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,084
-早 妈妈 -早 亲爱的
- Hi, mom. - Hi, sweetheart.

115
00:04:03,084 --> 00:04:05,320
这些花是哪儿来的啊
Ah, where did those come from?

116
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,260
没错 我以为朱顶红都开过季了呢
Yeah, I thought amaryllis were out of season.

117
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:09,100
我认识个熟人 我只是觉得
Oh, I got a guy. You know, I just thought

118
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:10,300
花能让家里看起来明亮一点
they'd brighten up the house a little bit.

119
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,660
你想得真是太周到了
Oh, that was so thoughtful of you.

120
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,760
我不觉得我家需要更明亮一点啊
I didn't realize that my house needed brightening up.

121
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,480
小公主来了
There she is!

122
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,498
歌洛莉亚 歌洛莉亚
Gloria! Gloria!

123
00:04:18,498 --> 00:04:21,360
哎呀 让我来帮你修复一下发型
Ay! Let me fix your hair!

124
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,980
那真是有爱啊
Oh. Well, isn't that sweet?

125
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:26,460
我不觉得她的发型糟糕啊
I didn't realize her hair was broken.

126
00:04:27,424 --> 00:04:29,200
闻起来好香啊
Ah! That smells delicious,

127
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,340
可我不能吃了 有个很早的工作午餐
but nothing for me. I've got an early work lunch.

128
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,640
是吗 我没听到救护车的声音啊
Really? I didn't hear an ambulance.

129
00:04:34,380 --> 00:04:37,100
好好笑哦 因为我已献身于法律事业
Yeah, it's funny because it's what I've dedicated my life to.

130
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:39,640
是和那个名字很搞笑的DJ见面吗
Oh, is this that meeting with the deejay with the funny name?

131
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,200
布克·贝尔
Booker Bell.

132
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,580
-布克·贝尔 -布克·贝尔吗
- Booker Bell. - Booker Bell?

133
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,660
大家听好了
Everybody now!

134
00:04:42,702 --> 00:04:44,900
布克·贝尔是史上最伟大的
Booker Bell was only the greatest deejay

135
00:04:44,900 --> 00:04:46,460
交通台广播DJ
in the history of drive time radio.

136
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,740
他有几块湿地被开放商看上了
Yeah, well, now he has some wetlands that developers want,

137
00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:50,520
我们希望让他捐给保护区
and we're trying to get him to donate for preservation.

138
00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:51,820
我还在跑公路生意那会儿
When I was on the road selling,

139
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,180
总是听布克的广播呢
I used to listen to Booker all the time.

140
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:55,260
"整盅电话"差不多就是他发明的
He practically invented the prank phone call.

141
00:04:55,660 --> 00:04:57,500
好了 祝我好运吧
Okay. Wish me luck.

142
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,400
好运哦 亲爱的
Good luck, sweetie!

143
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,060
布克会先搞一段恶作剧
Booker would play a prank,

144
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,740
那个倒霉蛋会被整得七窍生烟
the sucker would be twisting in the wind,

145
00:05:01,740 --> 00:05:03,420
就在你忍无可忍的时候
and just when you couldn't stand it anymore,

146
00:05:03,420 --> 00:05:05,860
他就会说 "猜猜整盅电话整到谁了"
he'd say, "Guess who just got their bell rung!"

147
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:07,440
老天 我真想见他一面
God, I'd love to meet him.

148
00:05:07,450 --> 00:05:09,160
他们就约在雷记餐厅
Oh, they're just going down to Rae's.

149
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:09,940
你赶快飞奔过去吧
You should pop down.

150
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,020
-他见到粉丝肯定很开心 -我没想好
- I'm sure he'd love to meet a fan. - I don't know.

151
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:14,180
有一次去见波兹·斯加格斯 我话都说不利索了
I met Boz Scaggs once, got all tongue-tied.

152
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:15,120
噢 你可以的
Oh, you'll be fine.

153
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,420
糟糕 莉莉 亲爱的 该去学校了
Oh! Oh, Lily, it's time for school, sweetie.

154
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:18,700
我可以送她去啊
Oh, I can take her.

155
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,800
那就太谢谢你了
Oh. That'd be great.

156
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:25,160
我正好帮你收拾收拾厨房
Yeah, it'd give me some more time to clean the kitchen.

157
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:26,980
扫扫尘之类的
Maybe do a little dusting.

158
00:05:27,578 --> 00:05:29,405
很好吃 小卡
Delicious, Cam.

159
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:36,720
安妮真棒 集风趣可爱贴心于一身
Annie was amazing, so funny and cute and sweet.

160
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:39,060
-要说几遍 -昨晚她画了幅画送我
- Yeah, you've said. - She made this for me last night.

161
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:42,200
瞧她的签名 "A"写得多萌啊 还打个卷儿
Look how she signs her name with that big loopy "A."

162
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,360
我得把它裱起来
I'm totally going to frame this.

163
00:05:44,992 --> 00:05:47,105
4年前我也给海莉画过一张
I made this for Haley four years ago.

164
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:50,540
您觉得这张被裱起来了吗
You think this got framed?

165
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:52,740
她捏成团扔垃圾桶了
She tossed it in the garbage...

166
00:05:53,736 --> 00:05:55,560
背面还写满了"海莉·乔纳斯三兄弟共有的夫人"
Right after she wrote "Mrs. Haley Jonas Brothers"

167
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,380
写了大概30遍
on it, like, 30 times.

168
00:05:58,754 --> 00:06:01,070
光是税金减免就已经很诱人了
The tax write-off alone makes financial sense.

169
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,760
更别提对环境的诸多好处了
You know, even if you take the environment out of it.

170
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,160
别不提环境问题啊
Well, don't take the environment out of it.

171
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,540
没了湿地 就没了鸭子
Without the wetlands, there's no ducks,

172
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:07,820
没了鸭子 就没东西让我射着玩了
and without the ducks, there's nothing for me to shoot at.

173
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,880
好吧 虽然我们考虑的角度不同
Okay. Well, we're shooting from two different angles,

174
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:12,720
但希望最终能达成一致意见
but, uh, hopefully we'll end up at the same place.

175
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:14,300
-米奇 -爸
- Mitch. - Dad?

176
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:17,320
我忍不住过来跟他打个招呼
I just had to stop down and meet this guy.

177
00:06:17,653 --> 00:06:19,033
布克·贝尔你好 我是波兹·斯加格斯
Booker Bell, I'm Boz Scaggs--

178
00:06:19,033 --> 00:06:22,020
错了 我是杰·普里契特 妈的
No! I mean Jay Pritchett. Damn it.

179
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:23,860
-很高兴见到你 -真是太荣幸了
- It's nice to meet you. - This is such an honor.

180
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:26,740
你一直是我最喜欢的电台主持人
You are hands down my favorite radio personality of all time.

181
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:27,640
你真会逗人开心
That's kind of you to say.

182
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:29,260
好了 谢谢你特意过来一趟 爸
Okay. Well, thanks for stopping by, dad.

183
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:30,480
我得跟你聊件趣事
You know, I gotta tell you one thing.

184
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,280
回头我们在家里聊吧
I'll see you back at the house.

185
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:34,300
有次我从扬斯敦开往糖果河
One time when I was driving from Youngstown to Sugar Creek,

186
00:06:34,300 --> 00:06:36,480
你给一个猫砂公司的人打去整盅电话
You called this guy at a kitty litter company

187
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,480
让他带900磅猫砂过去
and you asked him to bring over 900 pounds of litter,

188
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:41,780
当时背景音乐是一群狮子在咆哮
and in the background, you hear all these lions roaring, and...

189
00:06:46,349 --> 00:06:48,717
我都快把肺笑出来了 差点出事
I-I laughed so hard, I almost had an cicident.

190
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:49,880
车出事还是人出事
The car or you?

191
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,120
你还是那么逗
Funny as ever!

192
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:55,380
-随便吧 -你跟老一帮的还有联系吗
- Anyway... - Hey, are you still in touch...with the old gang?

193
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:57,220
时髦奶奶 还有宇航员克莱德
Grandma groovy? Spaceman Clyde?

194
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:59,580
-开玩笑吗 老一帮就是我 -骗谁呢
- Are you kidding? I am the old gang. - No way.

195
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:02,220
我或许老了 但跳起布吉舞来毫不费力
I may be old, but I still know how to boogie.

196
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:04,140
天呐 简直如她亲临现场
My god, it's like she's here!

197
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:05,240
就是她啊
She is here!

198
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:06,960
你怎么还不明白呢
How are you still not getting this?

199
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:07,980
那角色就是他演的
That's her.

200
00:07:08,053 --> 00:07:09,231
抱歉 一会就来
Excuse me for a sec.

201
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,720
你搞什么飞机啊
What are you doing?

202
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:14,780
咋了 我是他的粉丝 过来打个招呼而已
What? I'm a fan. I came down to say hi.

203
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:16,140
我们可是在进行工作会谈
This is a business meeting.

204
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,480
你完全没意识到很不合时宜吗
Do you have any idea how inappropriate this is?

205
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,580
当然 你肯定觉得无所谓
No. No, of course you don't,

206
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:21,800
因为在你看来 律师的工作不过是
because as far as you're concerned, all a lawyer does

207
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,680
走进法庭 面对法官 以及准备钓律师的白熊女
is walk into a bar with a rabbi and a polar bear.

208
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:27,220
是灰熊啦 不然的话 当酒保...
Grizzly, 'cause otherwise, when the bartender--

209
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:28,920
爸 我在工作
Dad! I'm working!

210
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:30,580
你是在丢我们父子两个人的脸
You're embarrassing both of us!

211
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:31,680
拜托您赶紧走吧
Please, you gotta go!

212
00:07:32,016 --> 00:07:33,620
好吧 我没意识到那一点
All right. I didn't realize that.

213
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:34,600
没错 你是没有
Yeah. Yeah. You didn't.

214
00:07:35,060 --> 00:07:36,040
抱歉 走吧
I'm sorry. Go.

215
00:07:39,340 --> 00:07:40,640
我的疯狂粉丝呢
Hey. Where's my stalker?

216
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:43,040
他走了 终于摆脱他了
Oh, he's gone. I got rid of him.

217
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,720
他缠着你喋喋不休 真不好意思
Sorry that he attacked you like that.

218
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:45,340
缠着
Attacked?

219
00:07:45,340 --> 00:07:47,468
没有的事 都习以为常了
No. I don't mind a little smoke up my bombers.

220
00:07:47,468 --> 00:07:49,648
我只是觉得工作商谈是件正经事
Well, I just thought since this was supposed a business meeting.

221
00:07:49,648 --> 00:07:50,360
我们应该
We should...

222
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,820
你觉得有个人让我心情愉快会
And you thought maybe having somebody make me feel good would

223
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:54,160
破坏商谈吗
wreck it?

224
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:56,740
我跟我爸的关系一直很紧张
There's--there's been a lot of tension between me and my dad.

225
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:58,644
我现在住在他家 所以有点
I'm actually staying at his house and it's just a...

226
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:00,820
所以你赶走一个为你敞开大门的人是吗
Oh, so you chased away a man who's opened his home to you?

227
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:03,500
我觉得我好像要搞砸了
I get the sense that I'm losing you.

228
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:05,700
我能跟时髦奶奶谈吗
Could I talk to Grandma Groovy?

229
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:07,560
亲爱的 我回来啦
Honey, I'm home!

230
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,680
这么早就回来了啊 亲爱的
Well, I didn't expect you so early, dear.

231
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,480
你怎么在啊
What? You?

232
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,260
看看谁来给咱家修桌子了
Yeah. Look who came by to fix the table.

233
00:08:14,260 --> 00:08:15,720
我正好有些闲工夫
Well, I had some time to kill,

234
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,780
所以就顺道来给你老婆送修理工具了
so I thought I'd drop by with that tool your wife needed.

235
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:19,562
-真是个大好人啊 -没错
- Wow. What a guy. - Yeah.

236
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,320
他还带了酒哦
He also brought some wine.

237
00:08:21,620 --> 00:08:23,080
昨晚你说你喜欢喝
Well, you said you liked it last night,

238
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,000
正好我家里有几瓶放着没人喝
so I had a couple extra bottles lying around.

239
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,180
老兄 女孩的心思都被你猜透了
Boy, do you know the way to this gal's heart.

240
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,040
我来不只是帮你家修桌子
I didn't just come here to fix your table

241
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,000
顺便把你老婆灌醉的
and get your wife drunk.

242
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,120
我其实是来告诉你
I actually decided to give you

243
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,540
由你来做我的房产经纪人
that listing on the sycamore property.

244
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:36,480
真的吗 太棒了
Really? That's great.

245
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,980
不如今晚到我家来吃晚饭吧
Yeah. Why don't you, uh, come over for dinner tonight?

246
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:41,560
我们可以谈谈细节 简单熟悉一下
And, uh, we'll work out all the details. One entree.

247
00:08:41,820 --> 00:08:42,860
克莱尔 你也一起来吧
Claire, you should come, too.

248
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:44,580
不了 不了 你们谈生意
Oh, no, no. No, no, if it's business--

249
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:45,160
我强烈要求
I insist.

250
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,758
-盛情难却 我们会到的 -好吧
- He insists. We'll be there. We're coming. - Okay.

251
00:08:46,758 --> 00:08:48,388
7点怎么样
Yeah, shall we say, uh, 7:00?

252
00:08:48,388 --> 00:08:49,900
-7点可以 -说定了
- 7:00 sounds great. - Okay.

253
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:50,280
好的
All right.

254
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:53,240
-不用送了 -行
- I'll let myself out. - Okay.

255
00:08:57,540 --> 00:08:58,020
惊了
Wow.

256
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,960
我也觉得很震惊
"Wow" Is right.

257
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,660
他说让我做经纪人
I just got sycamore--

258
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:04,580
那房子不用推销就能大卖 我白捡便宜了
A house that sells itself and gives me the commission.

259
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:07,060
你就一点都不在意吗
How does that not bother you?

260
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:08,420
克莱尔 我就那么一说
Claire, it's an expression.

261
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,880
还是要干活的啊 要检查房屋 估价
There's work. Inspections, appraisals--

262
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:11,860
他给我带酒
He brought me wine,

263
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:14,160
你不在的时候他把衬衫都脱了
He took his shirt off when you weren't here!

264
00:09:14,226 --> 00:09:15,500
酒是带给咱俩的
Um, he brought us wine,

265
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:17,140
而且 桌子下面也确实有点脏嘛
and it doesn't look super vacuumed down there.

266
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,560
他该把裤子也脱了才对
I'm surprised he kept his pants on.

267
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:20,240
好了 好了 我明白怎么回事了
Okay. Okay, I can see what's going on.

268
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,400
你太专注于拉他当客户
You--you're just so focused on getting his business,

269
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,300
以至于你没看到事情的真相
that you don't see what's going on in front of you.

270
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,860
好的 我现在看清了
Okay. Now I do see what's going on.

271
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,560
-看清什么 -过来 美妞
- What? - Come here, pretty girl.

272
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:31,220
-咋了 -你很美 只是我不常说而已
- What? Mm? - You are, you know. You don't hear it enough.

273
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:34,420
那一晚 你着上淡妆
The other night, when you put on makeup,

274
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:36,660
我心里想 "我老婆真美"
I was like, "There she is."

275
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,700
我的天呐
Oh, my god.

276
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:40,880
你觉得我是虚荣心作祟才瞎编乱造的吗
You think I'm making this up as some part of a-an ego boost?

277
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:43,197
你知道这有多侮辱人吗
Do you realize how insulting that is?

278
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:46,140
你在干嘛
What are you doing?

279
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,620
帮我的小妹妹做作业
Helping my little sister with her homework.

280
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,740
你手段 真卑劣
That seems... Mean.

281
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,520
安妮 这位是艾丽克斯
Annie, this is Alex.

282
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,900
就是我跟你说过的另一个妹妹
That other sister I was telling you about.

283
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:57,080
你好 很高兴见到你
Hi. So nice to meet you.

284
00:09:58,100 --> 00:10:00,060
如果你要在我的床上学习
Um, if you're going to study there,

285
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:02,197
还是把第7题到第10题答案改一下吧
You might need to correct numbers 7 through 10.

286
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:04,500
这张床的标准可比那张床高多了
This bed has higher standards than that bed.

287
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,100
我去再拿点柠檬水来
I'm going to get some more lemonade.

288
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:12,800
我觉得你姐姐生我们姐姐的气了
I think your sister's mad at our sister.

289
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,680
我们回来了
We're back!

290
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,820
终于回来了 我猜"吃完饭就回家"
Oh, well, there you are. I guess "Lunch then home"

291
00:10:21,820 --> 00:10:23,100
对不同的人有不同的意思哈
means different things to different people.

292
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:25,760
我带着小美女逛街了 莉莉 快过来
We had a girls' day. Lily, Lily, come!

293
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:27,560
给你爸爸看看我们买什么了
Show your papa what we bought!

294
00:10:27,755 --> 00:10:29,497
母女装
Matchy jackets!

295
00:10:29,555 --> 00:10:30,956
她穿上就跟小豹子一样
It's like she's the baby leopard,

296
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:32,420
而我是母豹子哟
And I'm the mama.

297
00:10:32,498 --> 00:10:33,862
或者就是两件普通的大衣
Or they just happened to have two jackets,

298
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:34,860
一件大号的 一件小号的
one large, one small.

299
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,940
抽屉里怎么了 我的茶哪去了
What happened here? Where is my tea?

300
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,420
茶在这边的抽屉里
Oh, it's in this drawer over here.

301
00:10:39,522 --> 00:10:40,600
为了感谢你
As a thank-you,

302
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,400
我花了点时间把你家厨房重新打理了一下
I took some time to rearrange your kitchen

303
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,200
好有条理一些
So it makes sense.

304
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:45,520
对谁有条理
To who?

305
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:47,860
对所有人啊 现在有层次感了 看着
To everyone. There's a flow now. Watch--

306
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:50,620
茶 马克杯 茶壶 不用谢
Tea. Mug. Kettle. You're welcome.

307
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,240
我又没谢你
I didn't thank you.

308
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,300
你不必谢
You don't have to.

309
00:10:54,300 --> 00:10:55,857
我没打算谢
I won't.

310
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,420
小卡 躲在我们的共用厕所里
Cam, our shared bathroom is not the place

311
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:11,100
可不是解决问题的办法
to work out whatever's going on here.

312
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,540
我是经历过父母离异的小孩
I'm a child of divorce.

313
00:11:13,140 --> 00:11:15,020
化解冲突可算是我的专长
Conflict resolution is something of a specialty.

314
00:11:15,540 --> 00:11:17,380
关键是 要跟当事人讲一个
The key is, tell a personal story

315
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,780
能引起他共鸣的故事
that applies to their situation,

316
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:20,480
就算现编也得编
even if you have to make one up.

317
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:22,560
那样的话 他们就会听到需要听到的道理
That way, they really hear what they need to hear.

318
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,920
抱歉 你说的对
I'm sorry. You're right.

319
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,680
不 抱歉我打扰到你了
No. I'm sorry I snapped.

320
00:11:29,180 --> 00:11:30,420
我只是对我喜欢的一个女生
I'm just going through some stuff

321
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:31,880
有点想法 她叫丹妮尔
with this girl I like, Danielle.

322
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:35,340
她前几天来我家 而斯黛拉老粘着她
She came over the other day, and Stella was all over her,

323
00:11:35,412 --> 00:11:36,840
然后 然后我就吃醋了
And--and I got jealous.

324
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,800
这有点不可理喻 对吧
Which is crazy, right?

325
00:11:37,860 --> 00:11:40,700
我是说 斯黛拉和她玩只是一种新鲜感
I mean, Stella was only playing with her because she was new.

326
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:43,880
曼尼 听起来丹妮尔想
Manny, sounds like Danielle was trying

327
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,060
破坏你和你的小狗之间的感情
to get between you and your puppy,

328
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,280
性质很恶劣啊
And that ain't cool.

329
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:49,040
她好像很不成熟 而你可以找个更好的
She seems immature, and you can do better.

330
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:51,020
我很抱歉直言不讳
I'm sorry to be blunt,

331
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:53,060
但是我自己现在也在经历感情波折
But I'm going through something myself right now.

332
00:11:54,289 --> 00:11:55,762
所以 振作点 好的
So, chin up. Okay.

333
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,240
虽然未必每次都管用
It may not work every time,

334
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,920
但你只需要搞定一位就可以了
but you only need one fish to bite.

335
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,340
那个丹妮尔是谁
Who is this Danielle?

336
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:03,060
她是我历史课上的学习搭档
She's my study partner in my history class,

337
00:12:03,163 --> 00:12:04,160
我们共享笔记的
and we share a notebook.

338
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,460
但她的笔记比较混乱
But her notes were really confusing,

339
00:12:05,460 --> 00:12:06,500
所以我将之列的井井有条的
so I put them in order.

340
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:09,000
而她非但不感谢我让学习变得更容易
Instead of thanking me for making our lives easier,

341
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,760
她还生我的气 因为她认为我在批评她
she got all mad because she thought I was judging her.

342
00:12:13,220 --> 00:12:15,100
那个女生相当不靠谱 曼尼
This girl is very bad news, Manny.

343
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:17,360
你离她远远的
You stay away from her.

344
00:12:22,940 --> 00:12:23,980
我们是菲尔和克莱尔
We're Phil and Claire.

345
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:24,720
我是 我是托尼
Hey, I'm Tony.

346
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:25,900
快进来 我去叫我爸爸
Come on in. I'll go get my dad.

347
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:27,140
-好的 -很好 谢谢
- Okay. - Great, thanks.

348
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:30,180
我不喜欢那孩子看你的方式
I don't like the way that kid was looking at you.

349
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:31,320
我们现在不是朋友
We are not friends right now.

350
00:12:31,397 --> 00:12:33,610
我只是过来帮忙搞点给孩子们上大学的钱
I am only here to help pump up the college fund.

351
00:12:33,687 --> 00:12:35,823
克莱尔 如果泰德对你毛手毛脚的
Claire, if Tad even makes a move towards you,

352
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:36,960
我就打的他屁股开花
His ass is... grass.

353
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:39,300
是吗 我以为只是我的虚荣心在幻想呢
Really? I thought that was just my ego.

354
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:40,900
目前 是的 但是你要明白
So far, yeah, but just know,

355
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,160
我已经准备好打得他屁股开花了
I'm ready to grass his ass.

356
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,060
嘿 两位
Hey, hey, hey, guys.

357
00:12:43,220 --> 00:12:44,280
嘿 你好吗
Hey! How are you!

358
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,980
-很好 -很高兴见到你
- Good. - Good to see you.

359
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:47,690
-好啊 -这就行了
- Yeah. - Hi. That's good.

360
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:50,520
这房子不错啊 你重装修了吗
Well, I love the place. Did you remodel this?

361
00:12:50,586 --> 00:12:51,857
事实上是我前妻搞的
Uh, actually, my ex-wife.

362
00:12:51,914 --> 00:12:54,134
她那个 很热衷于现代建筑
She had a, uh, passion for modern architecture

363
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:56,100
以及至少一位现代建筑师
and at least one modern architect.

364
00:12:57,426 --> 00:12:58,529
或许接下来也会把它卖掉
May have to sell this one next.

365
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,020
真的
Really?

366
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:00,900
我喜欢它的开放式结构
I love how open it is.

367
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,367
-你介意我 参观一下吗 -请便
- Do you mind if I, uh, poke around? - Please, yeah.

368
00:13:02,367 --> 00:13:03,345
真漂亮
Beautiful.

369
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,480
泰德 如果你不需要我照看孩子了
Tad, if you don't need my help anymore with the kids,

370
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:07,250
-那我就走了 -太感谢你了 艾伦
- I'll be going. -Thank you so much, Ellen.

371
00:13:07,310 --> 00:13:08,280
不客气
You're welcome.

372
00:13:08,350 --> 00:13:08,920
好的 我们回头见 再见
Okay. We'll see you later. Bye.

373
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:10,340
我8年前见过这房子
I saw this house eight years ago.

374
00:13:10,380 --> 00:13:11,760
这里以前有堵墙 对吧
There used to be a wall here, right?

375
00:13:11,820 --> 00:13:13,540
对 对的 不过已经改掉了
That's right. That's right. That was all covered.

376
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:16,460
我可是很注重细节的 别想逃过我法眼
Yeah.I'm a detail guy. Hard to get much past me.

377
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:17,900
好啊 好啊
Hello, hello!

378
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:19,012
-你好 卡拉阿姨 -你好吗
- Hi, aunt Kara! - How are you?

379
00:13:19,012 --> 00:13:20,059
我很好 泰德 你怎么样
Good, Tad, How you doing?

380
00:13:20,135 --> 00:13:21,760
-拜 爸爸 -拜 亲爱的
- Bye, daddy. - Bye, sweetie.

381
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,420
-拜 老板 -好好玩
- Bye, dad. - Have fun.

382
00:13:23,660 --> 00:13:24,580
好的 回头见
Okay. See you later.

383
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:25,717
快点孩子们 咱们走了
Come on, guys, let's go.

384
00:13:25,992 --> 00:13:28,343
楼梯以前是柚木的 对吧
These stairs used to be teak, am I right?

385
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:30,040
你老公真厉害啊
This guy's good.

386
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:31,580
是啊 他是很厉害
Yeah, he's good.

387
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:34,440
-他非常犀利 -我忘拿包了
- He's sharp. - I forgot my bag.

388
00:13:34,553 --> 00:13:37,667
你每次都这样
You do that every time.

389
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:38,300
没错
Yep.

390
00:13:38,655 --> 00:13:40,234
我从来都不放过任何细节
I don't miss much.

391
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:48,480
抱歉 你是想看书吗
Oh, I'm sorry. Were you trying to read?

392
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,200
你想看也看不懂啊
You're the one who tries to read.

393
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:52,147
擦 你妹的 姐还没那么笨呢
Oh, my gosh! I am not that stupid!

394
00:13:52,216 --> 00:13:53,095
说真的 海莉 你以为你是
Seriously, Haley, you think you

395
00:13:53,095 --> 00:13:54,518
-有史以来最酷的人啊 -你能不能
- are the coolest person ever! - Would you please stop

396
00:13:54,587 --> 00:13:55,437
别只要看见我干点啥就立马损我
just judging me and everything that I do?

397
00:13:55,437 --> 00:13:55,971
"看看姐 姐好拽啊"
"Look at me! I'm so cool!"

398
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:57,620
够了 够了
Enough! Enough!

399
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,300
我真是受够你们每天在一起掐架了
I am so sick of you two fighting all the time!

400
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:01,660
你是个坏大姐
You're a bad big sister,

401
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:03,540
而你也不是什么好二姐
And you're a bad little sister!

402
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:06,120
反正都是我的坏姐姐
And you're both bad big sisters to me.

403
00:14:06,539 --> 00:14:08,225
正常点吧
Be normaler.

404
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:15,780
我还没见过他这么发飙呢
I've never seen him like that.

405
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,660
我们确实有点忽视他的感受了
Well, we do kind of neglect him.

406
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:20,960
仔细想想吧
And if you think about it,

407
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:24,100
他有点像是 我们的小妹妹
he is kind of... our little sister.

408
00:14:25,420 --> 00:14:26,900
还记得以前我们怎么打扮他的吗
Remember how we used to dress him up?

409
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:28,360
我想她
I miss her.

410
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:29,340
我听见你们了
I hear you,

411
00:14:29,340 --> 00:14:30,760
而且我很不喜欢这对话的发展方向
and I don't like where this is going!

412
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:32,360
你负责拿口红
You get the lipstick,

413
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,680
我去拿胸罩和网球
I'll get the bra and tennis balls.

414
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:35,980
贝蒂·卢克
Betty Luke!

415
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,940
我会把这房子烧了的
I will burn this house down!

416
00:14:59,090 --> 00:15:01,107
乳酪磨碎机哪去了
Where is the cheese grater?

417
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,800
那切菜板呢
Where is the cutting board?

418
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:09,340
你想让它在哪
Where would you want it to be?

419
00:15:12,676 --> 00:15:15,702
是 就在乳酪磨碎机的旁边
Yes, right here next to the cheese grater.

420
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,780
我知道光看表面看不出来
I know it's hard to tell by looking at me,

421
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:20,140
但我真不是做主妇的料
But I am not a natural homemaker.

422
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,600
所以小卡对我的厨房整顿之后
So when Cam came and organized my kitchen,

423
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:26,080
我觉得失去了安全感 备受打击
I felt insecure and lashed out.

424
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:27,940
从某方面来说 我不比
In a way, I'm no better

425
00:15:27,998 --> 00:15:30,005
曼尼那不可理喻的朋友丹妮尔好多少
than Manny's crazy friend Danielle.

426
00:15:31,291 --> 00:15:33,103
拜托 我们能专心做菜吗
Please, can we just focus on the cooking?

427
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,040
爸爸 我们忘记给你这个了
Daddy, we forgot to give you this.

428
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:43,440
和我们的外套是一个系列哦
It's like our jackets.

429
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:46,880
我很喜欢
I love it.

430
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,860
我想我一直都对莉莉
I guess I've always been a little sensitive

431
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:52,300
没有妈妈的事情很敏感
about Lily not having a mother,

432
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:54,760
而歌洛莉亚很好地担当了这个角色
and Gloria's so good at it.

433
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:55,980
我有些吃醋
I got jealous.

434
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,720
也许我应该跟曼尼讲讲这个故事
Maybe I should tell Manny this story.

435
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:01,058
也许对他和那个灾星丹妮尔的事情有些帮助
It might help him with that train wreck Danielle.

436
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,160
你知道吗 何不重新打开音乐
You know what? Why don't you turn that music back on.

437
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:05,425
听起来很不错
Was kind of nice.

438
00:16:30,740 --> 00:16:31,540
爸爸
Hey, dad...

439
00:16:31,540 --> 00:16:32,860
你什么都不用说
No need to talk about it.

440
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:34,240
我突袭你们的商谈确实有点过分
I was out of line coming down there,

441
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:36,040
此类事情绝不会再发生了 酒在吧台上
won't happen again. Scotch is at the bar.

442
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:37,540
不 我想了很多
No, I've been giving this a lot of thought.

443
00:16:37,540 --> 00:16:38,591
你大概又要拉着我谈心了
I guess we're gonna talk about it.

444
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:39,820
我对你太无礼了
I was rude to you.

445
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:42,480
我想我只是有点恼火那些调侃律师的玩笑
I think I was just annoyed by all the lawyer jokes.

446
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:44,720
坦白一点讲 你对我的工作
I mean, let's be honest, you don't exactly

447
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,800
并不引以为豪
beam with pride over what I do for a living.

448
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,980
常言道 讽刺是最真挚的奉承
Mockery is the sincerest form of flattery.

449
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:50,355
我很确信 常言中可没那个说法
Pretty sure that's-- that's not the saying,

450
00:16:50,430 --> 00:16:52,844
不过 曼尼给我讲了一个
But, um, you know, Manny told me a story

451
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:53,860
关于他朋友丹妮尔的故事
about his friend Danielle.

452
00:16:54,540 --> 00:16:56,440
顺便说一句 听上去她是个了不起的人物
She sounds like a real piece of work, by the way.

453
00:16:57,086 --> 00:16:59,000
但是 那个故事让我意识到
But, uh, it made me realize that

454
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,040
我太把自己当回事了
I take myself a little too seriously.

455
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:04,840
听着 不用说我也一直都为你自豪
Listen, it goes without saying I've always been proud of you,

456
00:17:04,912 --> 00:17:06,844
也一直到处吹嘘你
and I brag about you all the time.

457
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:10,160
所以如果我说 "律师用什么来避孕"
So if I say, "What do lawyers use as birth control?"

458
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:11,800
答案通常是"他们令人讨厌的性格"
And the answer is, "Their personalities,"

459
00:17:11,940 --> 00:17:13,980
你要知道我不是指你
I want you to know I'm not referring to you.

460
00:17:15,140 --> 00:17:16,660
因为你压根儿不需要避孕
You don't need any birth control.

461
00:17:20,340 --> 00:17:20,900
你好
Hello?

462
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:23,040
是的 我是杰·普里契特
Yeah, this is Jay Pritchett.

463
00:17:24,580 --> 00:17:25,680
什么 什么时候
What? When?

464
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,480
发生什么了
What happened?

465
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,720
是警察 我的车被偷了
It's the police. My car got stolen.

466
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:30,180
是的 2012 灰色
Yeah, 2012. Gray.

467
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:33,460
不 不是蓝灰色 更像是淡
No, not pewter. More like a light...

468
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:34,877
像是 不 不是暗蓝色
Like a--no, not slate.

469
00:17:36,060 --> 00:17:37,880
我都不知道"雾灰色"是个什么色
I don't even know what "Coastal fog" Is.

470
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,420
写"灰色"就行了
Just put down "Gray."

471
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:40,980
奇洛吗
Kilo?

472
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:42,160
那不是我的车
It's not my car.

473
00:17:42,213 --> 00:17:43,367
对 她是哥伦比亚人
Yes, she's columbian.

474
00:17:43,420 --> 00:17:46,020
和这个有什么关系 不 我现在下去
What does that have to do with--no, I'm coming down there.

475
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:47,580
等等 带上钥匙
Hang on. Grab your keys.

476
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:49,020
我想我需要个律师
I think I might need a lawyer.

477
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:54,080
猜猜整盅电话整到谁了
Guess who just got his bell rung?

478
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:01,000
完全骗到他了
That's good.

479
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:02,060
真有两下子
That's good.

480
00:18:02,808 --> 00:18:04,402
来吧 请坐
Here we go. Have a seat.

481
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:06,880
我有一瓶1899年的波尔图葡萄酒
I got a bottle of port from 1899.

482
00:18:08,190 --> 00:18:10,239
好吧 其实是18.99美金的葡萄酒
Okay, I got it for $18.99...

483
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:12,000
不过是瓶好酒
but it's a good one.

484
00:18:16,135 --> 00:18:19,693
-今晚很棒 晚餐也很棒 -对吗 是的 而且
- Fun night, right? Great dinner? - Yes. Yes, and...

485
00:18:19,761 --> 00:18:21,912
泰德是个大好人
Tad is... great,

486
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:24,720
我知道我之前有些难为你
and I know I was giving you a hard time...

487
00:18:24,806 --> 00:18:27,016
但我觉得我应该说声对不起
But I feel like I should say that I am sorry.

488
00:18:27,102 --> 00:18:29,140
克莱尔 你不用解释
Hey, hey, hey, Claire, you don't need to explain.

489
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:30,880
你肯道歉已经让我受宠若惊了
Your apology is apology enough.

490
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:32,400
在哥斯达黎加的那个故事
Oh, I forgot the best part

491
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,540
我忘记讲最棒的部分了
of the Costa Rica story.

492
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:37,340
我们回家后 它们占据了客厅
So we get home, and they've taken over the living room,

493
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:38,640
占据了厨房
they've taken over the kitchen,

494
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:40,680
食物上 床上 到处都有它们的身影
I mean, they're in the food, they're on the bed.

495
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:45,000
终于 向迪亚戈抱怨了两年后
And finally, after two years of complaining to Diego about this,

496
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:46,460
他终于停止了 他说
he finally stops and says,

497
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:49,100
"好吧 现在我亲眼看到了
"Okay, now I see it.

498
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,140
你确实遇上猴群作乱了"
You do have a monkey problem."

499
00:18:56,520 --> 00:18:58,020
猴群作乱
A monkey problem!

500
00:18:58,080 --> 00:18:59,360
知道 他第一次说我就听清了
Yeah, I heard him the first time.

501
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:02,440
你可以亲吻我的妻子 可以和她滚床单
You can kiss my wife, you can take her to bed,

502
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:04,260
但是你不能逗她笑
but you cannot make her laugh.

503
00:19:06,366 --> 00:19:07,799
我要重来一遍
I wanna go back.

504
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,000
你可以亲吻我的妻子
You can kiss my wife,

505
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:12,800
但只有我能和她滚床单和逗她笑
But only I can take her to bed and make her laugh.

506
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:14,504
我要再来一遍
I wanna go back.

507
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:19,660
只有我可以和我的妻子滚床单
Only I can take my wife to bed,

508
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,480
逗号
comma,

509
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,100
和逗她笑
and make her laugh.

510
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:26,320
它们真的无处不在
I mean, they're in everything.

511
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:27,780
它们唯一没有碰的东西
The only thing they didn't touch--

512
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:29,060
居然是香蕉
the bananas.

513
00:19:31,820 --> 00:19:33,320
猴子爱香蕉
The monkeys love bananas!

514
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,260
天下哪有不爱香蕉的猴子
You would think they would love the bananas.

515
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:36,520
对 我们该走了
Yeah, we should go.

516
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,704
-没开玩笑吧 香蕉 -我们该走了
- Come on. The bananas-- - Yeah, we need to go.

517
00:19:38,704 --> 00:19:39,673
-我们该走了 -不不
- We gotta get going. - Oh, no, no, no.

518
00:19:39,673 --> 00:19:41,126
-时间太晚了 -但是他刚刚打开
- Yeah, yeah, we're late. - But he just opened the--

519
00:19:41,126 --> 00:19:43,113
-我们回家要晚了 -谢谢你的盛情款待
- We're late for getting home. - Thanks for everything. Just--

520
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:46,440
你有什么毛病
What is wrong with you?

521
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:48,260
你笑得花枝乱颤 像是说"谁先上我"
You laughed like it was "Who's on first?"

522
00:19:48,315 --> 00:19:48,800
什么
What?

523
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:51,000
他必须第二个上 别哄我
He's on second. Don't try to cheer me up.

524
00:19:51,060 --> 00:19:52,880
我知道了 你吃醋了
I know what's going on here. You're jealous.

525
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:54,420
吃他的醋吗
Of him?

526
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:56,220
他一点都不好笑
He's not even funny!

527
00:19:56,220 --> 00:19:58,460
他有什么 棍又软 时又短吗
What's he got? Like, a soft ten minutes?

528
00:19:58,518 --> 00:19:59,822
而且他去哥斯达黎加的故事
And he goes to the Costa Rican well

529
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:01,220
我的品位完全无法理解
a little too much for my taste.

530
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:02,520
天呐
Oh, god.

531
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,880
不是吧 还在笑猴子吗
Really? This is still about the monkey?

532
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,140
不不不
No! No, no, no!

533
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:09,240
是你 你现在让我很开心
It's you. You are making me so happy right now.

534
00:20:09,300 --> 00:20:12,000
你仓皇地逃出来了 简直像个傻子
You stormed out of there, and you're acting like an idiot.

535
00:20:12,074 --> 00:20:15,326
你喜欢吗 我真的相当不爽
You like this? Because I am really uncomfortable.

536
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:17,960
亲爱的 我太喜欢了 让我觉得倍受重视
Honey, I love it. Makes me feel special.

537
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:20,860
有时候 我真的搞不懂你在想什么
Sometimes, I really don't understand you.

538
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,560
我知道 有点傻
I know. It's stupid,

539
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:25,620
但是看到你为我而战感觉很好
but it's nice to know that sometimes you'll fight for me,

540
00:20:25,620 --> 00:20:28,000
而我只用对其他男人的故事笑笑就能看到
and all I have to do is laugh at some other guy's story.

541
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:31,040
但没有人能像你那样让我开怀大笑
But no one makes me laugh like you do.

542
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:34,140
只要这句永远是真的
As long as it's always genuine.

543
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:36,320
你的一切都可以是假的
You can fake anything you want with me,

544
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:37,220
只要笑容是真的就行
But not your laugh.

545
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:40,360
-我要重说一遍 -好
- I'd like to go back. - Yeah.

546
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:45,280
住手 走开
Stop it! Leave me alone!

547
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:47,420
-老实点 - 别动
- Hold still! - Stop moving!

548
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:48,980
我恨你们 走开
I hate you! Get off of me!

549
00:20:49,020 --> 00:20:50,880
干什么呢你们
What... is going on?

550
00:20:52,220 --> 00:20:53,960
你们有大麻烦了
You guys are in a lot of trouble.

551
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:56,240
海莉 我告诉过你把客厅收拾好
Haley, I told you to clean this mess up,

552
00:20:56,260 --> 00:20:57,820
艾丽克斯 你的书丢得到处都是
And, Alex, your books are everywhere.

553
00:20:58,240 --> 00:21:00,540
贝蒂·卢克娃娃 坐下来 你爸快去拿相机
Betty Luke, sit down while your dad gets the camera.

554
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:01,380
收到
Got it.

555
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:03,660
上次 你做了个鬼脸
Last time, you made a funny face

556
00:21:03,660 --> 00:21:05,540
所以我们没有拍到一张很好的照片
and we didn't really get a good shot,

557
00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:06,920
所以我们要练习微笑
so let's work on our smile.

558
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:09,680
好 见到你真高兴 贝蒂·卢克娃娃
Okay. Good to see you, Betty Luke.
